      "id": "https://www.agri-mutuel.com/politique-economie/linrae-va-developper-un-agent-ia-pour-accompagner-les-agriculteurs-face-aux-transitions/",
      "url": "https://www.agri-mutuel.com/politique-economie/linrae-va-developper-un-agent-ia-pour-accompagner-les-agriculteurs-face-aux-transitions/",
      "title": "[agri-mutuel.com] French institute plans AI farm adviser as Deere expands data tool",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://www.agri-mutuel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/90dec134-4-l-inrae-va-developper-un-agent-ia-pour-accompagner-les-agriculteurs-face-aux-tra.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🏔️ <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.agri-mutuel.com%2Fpolitique-economie%2Flinrae-va-developper-un-agent-ia-pour-accompagner-les-agriculteurs-face-aux-transitions%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\nFrance’s public agricultural research institute INRAE plans to build an AI assistant using verified scientific data to help farmers respond to climate change and other pressures. The project awaits approval for €1.2 million in France 2030 funding, with a first version planned for farmer testing within 18 months. Separately, John Deere expanded access to its free JD assistant on Nov. 16, linking it to the company’s Operations Center farm-management platform.\n\nINRAE’s proposed assistant would tailor guidance to a farm’s location, practices, soil, expected water resources and finances, while Deere’s tool searches and analyzes information already recorded about a user’s fields, machinery and farm operations. INRAE says the project has demonstrated answers to simple queries and aims to handle more complex questions; farmer testing depends on the funding decision.",
      "date_published": "2026-11-26T13:55:00+00:00",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "agri-mutuel.com",
          "url": "https://www.agri-mutuel.com"
        }
      ],
